ent-NCMetaNetworkPort = META network terminal
    .desc = A physical message endpoint. Wired traffic requires a connected data cable.
ent-NCMetaCyberdeck = META cyberdeck
    .desc = A battery powered local NET terminal. Use it on a reachable access point to connect.
ent-NCMetaNetworkCable = META data cable
    .desc = Connect its two ends to physical data ports. Excess distance or an obstruction breaks the route.
ent-NCMetaNeuralCyberdeck = META cyberdeck
    .suffix = neural interface
    .desc = A local NET deck with a neural interface. Black ICE can harm its operator when an operational powered neural implant is connected.
ent-NCMetaRadioJammer = META radio interference unit
    .desc = A battery powered interference emitter for local META radio channels. Its native emitter operates independently of loaded software.
ent-NCMetaDefenseCyberdeck = META cyberdeck
    .suffix = defense tool
    .desc = A local NET deck carrying a defense-only tool. Its profile is incompatible with data and control nodes.
ent-NCMetaDemoNetAccessPoint = local NET access point
    .desc = A local architecture entrance for a physical cable or an unobstructed radio link.
ent-NCMetaDemoNetData = local NET data node
    .desc = A data service exposing one configured virtual file after an authorized NET action.
ent-NCMetaDemoNetControl = local NET control node
    .desc = A scoped control service for one physically connected door that permits service control.
ent-NCMetaDemoNetFirewall = local NET firewall
    .desc = A protected node for native tool and defense resolution.
ent-NCMetaDemoNetBlackIce = local NET Black ICE
    .desc = A dangerous native defense. Its threat timer continues while META software is paused or stopped.
ent-NCMetaMarketplaceService = CitiNet software gateway
    .desc = A powered native software service. Connect a local data cable to browse, license and activate software through CitiNet.
